Z||000000||wxxo||04-17-2000||08:09 PM||||ok i was at the garage today and they mentioned something about updating the proms in my 86 se v6 4spd. i know that there is an updated one but what is it for?? will it help with performance. my performance sucks really bad haha. ||||reg||1
Z||000001||1FST2M6||04-18-2000||08:36 AM||||you will notice a smoother idle and lowered operating temperature. On the dyno I saw a gain in the curve but not at peak.. which is more useable than peak anyway. I had an ADS Superchip (86 4spd). You will notce a slump in gas mileage just cause you'll be driving the car harder than usual but once you get used to it your mileage will be fine again... at least thats my findings...  ("in the curve" refers to 1300-5200rpm or just before peak HP and Tq. Readings)   ||||reg||1
